---
import Layout from "../../../layouts/Layout.astro";
import Container from "../../../components/common/Container.astro";
---

<Layout
  title="Nishikino｜TOUSAKA GOTEN｜WORKS"
  description="TOUSAKA GOTEN was the first Japanese-style building I created in Minecraft Java Edition. Built as a residence within an original Japanese-style castle I had planned at the time, it became one of my earliest works."
>

<!-- Hero -->
<section class="relative h-[920px] overflow-hidden bg-[#f5f1ea]">

  <picture>
    <img
      src="/images/tousakagoten.jpg"
      alt="東坂御殿"
      class="work-hero absolute inset-0 h-full w-full object-cover pointer-events-none select-none"
      draggable="false"
    />
  </picture>

  <div class="absolute inset-0 z-20 flex items-center">

    <Container>

      <div class="hero-content max-w-3xl">

        <p
          class="mt-10 text-base tracking-[0.45em] text-[#f6e8c8]"
          style="font-family:'Cormorant Garamond',serif;"
        >
          TOUSAKA GOTEN
        </p>

        <h1
          class="mt-1 text-[36px] leading-[1.15] text-white"
          style="font-family:'Shippori Mincho',serif;"
        >
          東坂御殿
        </h1>

        <p
          class="mt-6 text-xl text-white"
          style="font-family:'Shippori Mincho',serif;"
        >
          My first Japanese-style building in Java Edition.
        </p>

        <div class="mt-12 flex items-center">
          <div class="h-[1px] w-[360px] bg-[#caa14d]"></div>
        </div>

      </div>

    </Container>

  </div>

  <div class="absolute bottom-16 right-12 z-30 flex flex-col items-center">

    <div class="h-20 w-px bg-white/70"></div>

    <span class="mt-4 text-base tracking-[0.45em] text-white">
      SCROLL
    </span>

  </div>

</section>


<!-- Introduction -->
<section class="relative bg-[#f8f6f2] overflow-hidden works-detail">

  <img
    src="/images/washi-bg.png"
    alt=""
    class="absolute right-0 top-0 h-full w-full opacity-[0.3] pointer-events-none select-none -z-0"
  />

  <Container class="py-32 relative z-10">

    <div class="mx-auto max-w-6xl">

      <div class="flex items-center gap-6">

        <span class="h-px w-24 bg-[#caa14d]"></span>

        <p
          class="text-base tracking-[0.45em] text-[#9a8358]"
          style="font-family:'Cormorant Garamond',serif;"
        >
          OVERVIEW
        </p>

      </div>

      <h2
        class="mt-8 text-3xl text-[#2b2724]"
        style="font-family:'Shippori Mincho',serif;"
      >
        About the Work
      </h2>

      <p
        class="mt-10 max-w-4xl text-base leading-10 text-[#55504a]"
        style="font-family:'Shippori Mincho',serif;"
      >
        Built on August 12, 2016, this was the first Japanese-style building I created in Minecraft Java Edition.<br>
        It was originally planned as a residence within an original Japanese-style castle, but the castle itself was never completed.
      </p>

    </div>


    <div class="mx-auto mt-24 grid max-w-6xl gap-16 lg:grid-cols-[1fr_360px]">

      <div>

        <div class="flex items-center gap-5">

          <span class="h-px w-20 bg-[#caa14d]"></span>

          <p
            class="text-base tracking-[0.4em] text-[#9a8358]"
            style="font-family:'Cormorant Garamond',serif;"
          >
            HISTORY
          </p>

        </div>

        <h2
          class="mt-8 text-3xl text-[#2b2724]"
          style="font-family:'Shippori Mincho',serif;"
        >
          The Story of TOUSAKA GOTEN
        </h2>

        <p
          class="mt-10 text-base leading-10 text-[#4f4944]"
          style="font-family:'Shippori Mincho',serif;"
        >

        The first building I ever made in Minecraft was the “First Prototype Edo Castle,” which I created in Pocket Edition.
        A few months later, on August 12, 2016, I began working with Java Edition, and TOUSAKA GOTEN became the first Japanese-style building I created there.

        <br><br>

        TOUSAKA GOTEN was not originally planned as a standalone building. I created it as a residence within an original Japanese-style castle that I was planning at the time.
        
        <br><br>

        In the end, I began work on the Second Prototype Edo Castle instead of continuing with the planned castle, leaving TOUSAKA GOTEN as the only completed part of that original project.

        <br><br>

        When I later replaced my PC, I had kept a copy of the world data from that time. Thanks to that, I was able to preserve the old world without losing the original data, and the building remains in the state it was in 2016.

        <br><br>

        As I continued creating Japanese-style architecture, my approach gradually shifted toward recreating real castles, residences, and other historical buildings.

        </p>
      </div>


      <aside class="relative">

        <div
          class="rounded-[2rem] border border-[#e2d8cb] bg-[#fffdfa] p-10 shadow-[0_20px_60px_rgba(0,0,0,.07)]"
        >

          <p
            class="text-base tracking-[0.4em] text-[#a68b64]"
            style="font-family:'Cormorant Garamond',serif;"
          >
            DATA
          </p>

          <div class="mt-10 space-y-8">

            <div>
              <p class="text-base text-[#8c8378]">Title</p>
              <p class="text-base">TOUSAKA GOTEN</p>
            </div>

            <div>
              <p class="text-base text-[#8c8378]">Category</p>
              <p class="text-base">Japanese Architecture・Residence</p>
            </div>

            <div>
              <p class="text-base text-[#8c8378]">Date Built</p>
              <p class="text-base">August 12, 2016</p>
            </div>

            <div>
              <p class="text-base text-[#8c8378]">Location</p>
              <p class="text-base">
                World preserved for archival purposes
              </p>
            </div>

            <div>
              <p class="text-base text-[#8c8378]">Builder</p>
              <p class="text-base">Nishikino</p>
            </div>

            <div>
              <p class="text-base text-[#8c8378]">Type</p>
              <p class="text-base">Residence・Estate</p>
            </div>

            <div>
              <p class="text-base text-[#8c8378]">Environment</p>
              <p class="text-base">
                Minecraft: Java Edition<br>
                Forge 1.10.2
              </p>
            </div>

            <div>
              <p class="text-base text-[#8c8378]">Style</p>
              <p class="text-base">Japanese Architecture</p>
            </div>

            <div>
              <p class="text-base text-[#8c8378]">Status</p>
              <p class="text-base">Completed and preserved in an archival world</p>
            </div>

          </div>

        </div>

      </aside>

    </div>


    <!-- Gallery -->

    <div class="mx-auto mt-32 max-w-6xl">

      <div class="flex items-center gap-5">

        <span class="h-px w-20 bg-[#caa14d]"></span>

        <p
          class="text-base tracking-[0.45em] text-[#a58c65]"
          style="font-family:'Cormorant Garamond',serif;"
        >
          GALLERY
        </p>

      </div>

      <h2
        class="mt-6 text-4xl"
        style="font-family:'Shippori Mincho',serif;"
      >
        Gallery
      </h2>

      <div class="gallery mt-12">

        <div class="gallery-frame">
          <img
            src="/images/tousakagoten.jpg"
            alt="東坂御殿 全景"
          />
        </div>

        <div class="gallery-frame">
          <img
            src="/images/tousakagoten1.jpg"
            alt="東坂御殿 全景"
          />
        </div>

        <div class="gallery-frame">
          <img
            src="/images/tousakagoten2.jpg"
            alt="東坂御殿 内装"
          />
        </div>

      </div>

    </div>


    <!-- Navigation -->

    <div class="mt-24 flex flex-wrap gap-4">

      <a
        href="/en/works/"
        class="inline-flex rounded-full border border-[#d7c8b3] bg-white px-8 py-4 text-base transition hover:bg-[#2b2724] hover:text-white"
      >
        ← View More Works
      </a>

      <a
        href="/en/nishikinoedocastle1/"
        class="inline-flex rounded-full border border-[#d7c8b3] bg-white px-8 py-4 text-base transition hover:bg-[#2b2724] hover:text-white"
      >
        First Build →
      </a>

    </div>


         <!-- Share -->

    <div class="mt-32 text-center">

      <div class="flex items-center justify-center gap-5">

        <span class="h-px w-16 bg-[#caa14d]"></span>

        <p
          class="text-base tracking-[0.45em] text-[#a58c65]"
          style="font-family:'Cormorant Garamond',serif;"
        >
          SHARE
        </p>

        <span class="h-px w-16 bg-[#caa14d]"></span>

      </div>

      <h2
        class="mt-6 text-3xl text-[#2b2724]"
        style="font-family:'Shippori Mincho',serif;"
      >
        Share This Work
      </h2>

      <div class="mt-8 flex justify-center gap-4 flex-wrap">

        <a
          href="#"
          id="x-share"
          target="_blank"
          rel="noopener noreferrer"
          class="rounded-full border border-[#d7c8b3] bg-white px-7 py-3 text-base hover:bg-[#2b2724] hover:text-white"
        >
          X
        </a>

        <button
          type="button"
          id="instagram-share"
          class="rounded-full border border-[#d7c8b3] bg-white px-7 py-3 text-base hover:bg-[#2b2724] hover:text-white"
        >
          Instagram
        </button>

        <button
          type="button"
          id="copy-url"
          class="rounded-full border border-[#d7c8b3] bg-white px-7 py-3 text-base hover:bg-[#2b2724] hover:text-white"
        >
          Copy URL
        </button>

      </div>

    </div>

  </Container>

</section>


<script>
  const pageUrl = "https://www.nishikinolab.net/en/tousakagoten/";

  const sharePhrases = [
    "Found this.",
    "I kind of like this.",
    "Look at this.",
    "Found something interesting.",
    "Found something like this.",
    "Have you seen this?",
    "Found something.",
    "Came across this.",
    "Found something worth checking out."
  ];

  const randomPhrase =
    sharePhrases[Math.floor(Math.random() * sharePhrases.length)];

  const shareText =
    `${randomPhrase} Minecraft 東坂御殿 | WORKS`;

  const xShareButton = document.getElementById("x-share");
  const copyButton = document.getElementById("copy-url");
  const instagramButton = document.getElementById("instagram-share");

  xShareButton?.setAttribute(
    "href",
    `https://x.com/intent/post?text=${encodeURIComponent(shareText)}&url=${encodeURIComponent(pageUrl)}`
  );

  copyButton?.addEventListener("click", async () => {
    try {
      await navigator.clipboard.writeText(pageUrl);

      if (copyButton) {
        copyButton.textContent = "Copied";

        setTimeout(() => {
          copyButton.textContent = "Copy URL";
        }, 2000);
      }
    } catch (error) {
      console.error(error);
    }
  });

  instagramButton?.addEventListener("click", () => {

    const dialog = document.createElement("div");

    dialog.innerHTML = `
      <div
        id="instagram-share-overlay"
        style="
          position:fixed;
          inset:0;
          z-index:9999;
          display:flex;
          align-items:center;
          justify-content:center;
          padding:24px;
          background:rgba(43,39,36,.55);
          backdrop-filter:blur(6px);
        "
      >
        <div
          style="
            width:100%;
            max-width:420px;
            padding:36px;
            border:1px solid #e2d8cb;
            border-radius:28px;
            background:#fffdfa;
            box-shadow:0 20px 60px rgba(0,0,0,.18);
            text-align:center;
          "
        >

          <p
            style="
              margin:0;
              font-family:'Cormorant Garamond',serif;
              font-size:14px;
              letter-spacing:.35em;
              color:#a58c65;
            "
          >
            SHARE
          </p>

          <h3
            style="
              margin:14px 0 0;
              font-family:'Shippori Mincho',serif;
              font-size:24px;
              color:#2b2724;
              font-weight:400;
            "
          >
            Share on Instagram
          </h3>

          <p
            style="
              margin:20px 0 0;
              font-family:'Shippori Mincho',serif;
              font-size:14px;
              line-height:2;
              color:#625a52;
            "
          >
            The URL of this work page will be copied<br>
            and Instagram will be opened.
          </p>

          <button
            id="instagram-open"
            type="button"
            style="
              width:100%;
              margin-top:28px;
              padding:14px 20px;
              border:1px solid #d7c8b3;
              border-radius:999px;
              background:#2b2724;
              color:#fff;
              font-family:'Shippori Mincho',serif;
              font-size:15px;
              cursor:pointer;
            "
          >
            Copy URL & Open Instagram
          </button>

          <button
            id="instagram-cancel"
            type="button"
            style="
              width:100%;
              margin-top:10px;
              padding:12px 20px;
              border:0;
              background:transparent;
              color:#8c8378;
              font-family:'Shippori Mincho',serif;
              font-size:14px;
              cursor:pointer;
            "
          >
            Cancel
          </button>

        </div>
      </div>
    `;

    document.body.appendChild(dialog);

    const overlay = document.getElementById("instagram-share-overlay");
    const openButton = document.getElementById("instagram-open");
    const cancelButton = document.getElementById("instagram-cancel");

    openButton?.addEventListener("click", async () => {

      try {
        await navigator.clipboard.writeText(pageUrl);
      } catch (error) {
        console.error(error);
      }

      window.open(
        "https://www.instagram.com/",
        "_blank",
        "noopener,noreferrer"
      );

      overlay?.remove();
    });

    cancelButton?.addEventListener("click", () => {
      overlay?.remove();
    });

    overlay?.addEventListener("click", (event) => {
      if (event.target === overlay) {
        overlay.remove();
      }
    });

  });
</script>


<style>

.work-hero{
  animation:heroFloat 12s ease-in-out infinite;
  transform-origin:center;
}

@keyframes heroFloat{

  0%{
    transform:scale(1.03) translateY(0);
  }

  50%{
    transform:scale(1.06) translateY(-18px);
  }

  100%{
    transform:scale(1.03) translateY(0);
  }

}

section{
  position:relative;
}

section::before{
  content:"";
  position:absolute;
  left:0;
  top:0;
  width:100%;
  height:100%;
  pointer-events:none;
  background-image:
    radial-gradient(circle at 8% 10%,rgba(205,175,98,.08),transparent 18%),
    radial-gradient(circle at 92% 82%,rgba(205,175,98,.06),transparent 22%);
}

aside{
  position:sticky;
  top:120px;
  height:max-content;
}

a{
  transition:.35s;
}

@media(max-width:1100px){

  section{
    overflow:hidden;
  }

}

@media(max-width:900px){

  aside{
    position:relative;
    top:auto;
  }

}

@media(max-width:768px){

  section:first-child{
    height:760px;
  }

  .work-hero{
    animation:none;
  }

}


.gallery-frame {
  position: relative;
  padding: 2px;
  border-radius: 1.25rem;

  background:
    linear-gradient(
      to right,
      transparent 0%,
      rgba(253, 164, 175, 0.65) 25%,
      rgba(252, 211, 77, 0.65) 50%,
      rgba(125, 211, 252, 0.65) 75%,
      transparent 100%
    );

  overflow: hidden;
}

.gallery-frame img {
  display: block;
  width: 100%;
  height: auto;

  border-radius: calc(1.25rem - 2px);

  background: #f8f6f2;
}

.gallery-frame:hover {
  background:
    linear-gradient(
      to right,
      transparent 0%,
      rgba(253, 164, 175, 0.9) 25%,
      rgba(252, 211, 77, 0.9) 50%,
      rgba(125, 211, 252, 0.9) 75%,
      transparent 100%
    );
}

</style>

</Layout>